{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flip coins to earn money</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618390/extras/8957a89869e55074c8041dc20dbfd1a8.poster.avif?t=1760293095\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618390/extras/8957a89869e55074c8041dc20dbfd1a8.webm?t=1760293095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618390/extras/8957a89869e55074c8041dc20dbfd1a8.mp4?t=1760293095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click a coin to toss it. Every time it lands on Heads, you earn money. Simple. Satisfying. Strangely compelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buy coins &amp; upgrades</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618390/extras/b87b33b59c356ed9d78296180bff05a1.poster.avif?t=1760293095\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618390/extras/b87b33b59c356ed9d78296180bff05a1.webm?t=1760293095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618390/extras/b87b33b59c356ed9d78296180bff05a1.mp4?t=1760293095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more coins you own, the more you can flip. Buy upgrades to make them flip faster and yield more money. Discover curious interactions and unexpected synergies between different coin types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618390/extras/bbd5f82a64498fb599171f6e2557e05b.poster.avif?t=1760293095\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618390/extras/bbd5f82a64498fb599171f6e2557e05b.webm?t=1760293095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618390/extras/bbd5f82a64498fb599171f6e2557e05b.mp4?t=1760293095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire little helpers to take care of all the manual labour for you. They don\u2019t complain, and they never question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ascend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618390/extras/6e1d27a4a44b63990ea3d52c1e966230.poster.avif?t=1760293095\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618390/extras/6e1d27a4a44b63990ea3d52c1e966230.webm?t=1760293095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618390/extras/6e1d27a4a44b63990ea3d52c1e966230.mp4?t=1760293095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Leave your fortune behind and rise to something greater. Start again with peculiar new talents you didn\u2019t have before. Progress feels natural\u2026 almost guided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prosper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618390/extras/e761578fd2dd4bfca61c0bc97cb87467.poster.avif?t=1760293095\" width=616 height=150 ><sou